    "detailed_description": "Manage a zombie colony. Mine, build, master new technologies, do everything to capture these pitiful people and their juicy brains!<br><br>Many years have passed since the mass infection and the transformation of humanity into zombies. Even though there are still survivors who are resisting, being a zombie is still boring. But what if... we build a new Zombie Social Society?<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Develop your zombie settlement.<br></li><li>Research new undead technologies.<br></li><li>Make decisions in random events.<br></li><li>Keep an eye on the needs of the residents (yes, you thought zombies didn\u2019t have needs?).<br></li><li>Try to turn uncouth fools into decent citizens.</li></ul>",
